  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3: the interface now matches the other tools in the suite - one compact header, the same cards, tables and spacing. It also no longer switches to a dark theme when the tool is opened as a web resource inside Dynamics 365 on a machine set to dark mode; it stays light, like the app around it. This is a visual change only; nothing about how the tool finds or restores records has changed.",
